<title>USA: EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly Report - Year-To-Date U.S. Oil Demand.</headline>
<text>
<p>Averages (1,000 bbls/day) for first 100 days of 1997:</p>
<p>---------------------------1997------1996----Pct Chg</p>
<p> Gasoline..................7,587.....7,546......0.5</p>
<p> Distillate Fuel ..........3,580.....3,593.....-0.4</p>
<p> Residual Fuel...............849.......936.....-9.3</p>
<p> Jet Fuel..................1,574.....1,596.....-1.4</p>
<p> Other Oils................4,550.....4,575.....-0.5</p>
<p> Total Products Supplied..18,139....18,247.....-0.6</p>
<p> Domestic Crude Output.....6,437.....6,516.....-1.2</p>
<p> Crude Imports (Exc SPR)...7,546.....7,024......7.4</p>
<p> Refinery Crude Runs......13,723....13,726.....Unch</p>
</text>
